title: mf duplicate clear
tags: [[CLI command]] Duplicates
kind: reference
summary: Delete every duplicate group and every link to one (the hashes are kept)

Removes duplicate detection's footprint — every link to a group, then every group
metarecord — after a confirmation (`-y` skips it). The hash cache is kept
([[The duplicate hash cache]]). It is written as ''two'' revisions (the links,
then the groups), so undoing it takes two undos.
